            </div>

            <div class="legal-section">
                <h2 id="description-of-service">2. Description of Service</h2>
                <p>CertiFried MultiTool is a Discord bot with the following features:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Multi-platform go-live streaming notifications (Twitch, Kick, YouTube, Rumble, TikTok)</li>
                    <li>Social media feed notifications (YouTube, Twitter/X, Bluesky, TikTok videos and RSS)</li>
                    <li>Greenhouse Tycoon, a plant-growing game played on the website, in a Twitch panel extension and through Discord commands</li>
                    <li>Music playback with AI DJ and text-to-speech functionality</li>
                    <li>Server moderation, security, anti-raid, anti-nuke, and phishing detection tools</li>
                    <li>Economy systems with currency, shop, pets, gambling, and trading</li>
                    <li>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5e RPG (<code>/rpg</code>) with characters, combat, dungeons, party play, and PvP</li>
                    <li>Word games (Last Letter, One Word Story, Coordle, WordSeek), Cards Against Humanity, trivia, hangman, counting, arcade, and OwO integration</li>
                    <li>Leveling, XP tracking, and rank card customization</li>
                    <li>Custom forms, ticket systems, and support workflows</li>
                    <li>Stream Team signups &mdash; apply to a creator&rsquo;s stream team via private application tickets</li>
                    <li>Birthday tracking with digital birthday cards and collaborative signing</li>
                    <li><strong>Standalone Group Greeting Cards</strong> at <a href="/cards">certifriedmultitool.com/cards</a> &mdash; free digital group cards for any occasion (birthdays, farewells, thank yous, congratulations, and more) with unlimited signers, no account required</li>
                    <li>AI-generated card cover images (Google Gemini, with Hugging Face as a fallback)</li>
                    <li>Voice message recording (up to 30 seconds) on greeting cards</li>
                    <li>Encrypted digital gift card code attachment (AES-256-GCM encryption)</li>
                    <li>Scheduled channel purge and auto-cleanup tools</li>
                    <li>Custom embeds, reaction roles, and stat display channels</li>
                    <li>Twitch schedule images posted to Discord</li>
                    <li>Creator integrations: Buy Me a Coffee supporter announcements, Throne wishlists, Fourthwall shop, and Steam game watcher</li>
                    <li>Guided <code>/setup</code> onboarding wizard for configuring features</li>
                    <li>Custom bot instances (self-service or managed)</li>
                    <li>Web dashboard at certifriedmultitool.com for server management</li>
                    <li>A stream bot for your own Twitch and Kick channels: automations on follows, subs, cheers, raids, channel points, polls and tips; chat commands and timers; stream management; song requests</li>
                    <li><a href="/studio">CertiFried Studio</a>, a free Windows app that carries out stream bot actions on your PC (OBS control, sounds, hotkeys, voice commands, OBS docks)</li>
                    <li>And many additional features</li>
                </ul>
                <p>We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of our services at any time without prior notice.</p>
